New screens should put [single_back_action_bar.dart](mdc:lib/views/player/widgets/bottom_actions/single_back_action_bar.dart) in the bottom nav bar. No action bar button at the top, just a title. New strings go in [string_constants.dart](mdc:lib/constants/strings/string_constants.dart) with a description of how they are used.